	<content contentuid="hfa009cc9g782dg4d73g86b7g08b98ea9bc7f" version="1">葬火平衡：I</content>
	<content contentuid="h223abd17gfffdg453eg9798g03055be7c138" version="1">葬火平衡：II</content>
	<content contentuid="h1e9d019bg3fc7g4c38gb4cagbc405ccfa35e" version="1">葬火平衡：III</content>
	<content contentuid="hb26d3d20gb6eeg4034g921fg9d5dfa7701e9" version="1">葬火平衡：IV</content>
	<content contentuid="hbbdf2c6agde0fg444bga14bgb400eab7ba3d" version="1">葬火平衡：V</content>
	<content contentuid="he41ccfe8g3508g412bg8129ge7a9ba1dd83d" version="1">葬火平衡：VI</content>
	<content contentuid="h7f3607dage23dg4a29ga3f5g09dbd87cb5e8" version="1">葬火平衡：VII</content>
	<content contentuid="h2da0a147ge027g4f50gacbcgccc2a03c9f54" version="1">葬火平衡：VIII</content>
	<content contentuid="h0abbca0ag857ag46b1g8d28g8484160b64f0" version="1">葬火平衡：IX</content>
	<content contentuid="hfd8476a8gbca1g4880g97cege37a408b25f8" version="1">葬火平衡：X</content>
	<content contentuid="h0a580ae8g774eg4e0ag804agb1d9ee74437b" version="1">葬火為求得&lt;b&gt;平衡&lt;/b&gt;而努力攀升的目標等級。&lt;br&gt;你的&lt;b&gt;魔法裝備&lt;/b&gt;、甚至&lt;b&gt;符文碎片&lt;/b&gt;都會影響這個數字，&lt;b&gt;難度模式&lt;/b&gt;同樣如此。&lt;br&gt;葬火&lt;b&gt;每輪更新一次&lt;/b&gt;，在首領的回合開始時（若首領已死，則在該輪開始時）。&lt;br&gt;你一輪之內從敵人身上削掉的生命值越多，葬火漲得越快。拖長的戰鬥本身也會讓它加速。</content>
	<content contentuid="hb93bc457geaffg455bgbe32g96564bdc08a7" version="1">葬火：正在攀升</content>
	<content contentuid="h4420b73fgd2beg4a6dgbb2ag90ac91392e28" version="1">葬火正在攀升。只有針對葬火的能力，或倒地的隊友，才能把它壓下去。</content>
	<content contentuid="h68c31c1dg1b68g4599g88feg007e9f4a6d98" version="1">葬火：正在消退</content>
	<content contentuid="h2cf7c024g3c58g4454gb72fg346cd3b63c88" version="1">葬火正在消退：有隊友倒地。所有人重新站起後，它會再度攀升。</content>
	<content contentuid="h4f8f2b80geee5g4b8cg9c37g4540a2e28572" version="1">葬火：已被鎮服</content>
	<content contentuid="h51075992g8560g40b3ga23fgd562f1af10d5" version="1">葬火已被鎮服，在這場戰鬥中不會再攀升。</content>
</contentList>
